# Prose that is allowed to appear in two files. See
# DEVELOPERS.md#1-one-topic-one-place for when an entry here is the right
# answer, which is seldom.
#
# One paragraph per allowance: the two files it covers, one per line, then the
# passage. The pair is what makes it deliberate -- a third copy is news
# whatever those two agreed -- and an allowance nothing matches is reported, so
# the baseline cannot outlive the repetition it recorded.
#
# There are none. Keep it that way.
